# Billing skill stays in sync

You are on Billing paths. Product facts an agent cannot infer live in
`.claude/skills/billing-mytrion/SKILL.md` (mirrored to `.cursor/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`).

If this change touches **schema, routes, tabs, ledger sections, parked flags, or API caps**,
update that skill in the **same PR** (all three mirrors). Read the skill before editing
Billing UI or APIs.

Billing ≠ Finance. Do not treat `mytrions/finance/**` as this desk. Do not restyle
`MytrionShell` sidebar/header.
